The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB):

Healthcare institution:
A Healthcare institution represents every place, institution, building or agency, whether organised for profit or not, which provides facilities with medical services, nursing services, health screening services, other health‐related services, supervisory care services, personal care services or directed care services.
