    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">DEFINITION:
Architecture Requirement ABB is a Requirement being formulated as an agreed normative statement of a To-Be European Public Service

Source: European Commission, ISA Programme
(&lt;a href=&quot;https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/sites/default/files/eif_brochure_final.pdf&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/sites/default/files/eif_brochure_final.pdf&lt;/a&gt;)

