Example: The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): Microsoft Power BI - Power BI is a business analytics service by Microsoft. It aims to provide interactive visualizations and business intelligence capabilities with an interface simple enough for end users to create their own reports and dashboards. It is part of the Microsoft Power Platform.(&lt;a href=&quot;https://powerbi.microsoft.com/it-it/what-is-power-bi/&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://powerbi.microsoft.com/it-it/what-is-power-bi/&lt;/a&gt;)

IoP Dimension: Behavioral IoP

LOST view: Technical view - application

Interoperability saliency: The Data Analytics Service ABB &amp;nbsp;is salient for technical interoperability because it enables the automated processing and analysis of different data source.

