  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/EifInteroperabilityLevelBusinessObject">
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: EIF Interoperability Level ABB is a Business Object setting guidelines for developing public services. The EIF defines four interoperability levels, which cover legal, organisational, semantic and technical interoperability. Each level deserves special attention when a new European public service is established.

Source: European Commission, ISA Programme. The New European Interoperability Framework (EIF) for European public services. [Online] 2017

Source reference: (&lt;a href=&quot;https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/eif_en&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/eif_en&lt;/a&gt;.)

