Identifier: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/EifInteroperabilityLevelBusinessObject&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/EifInteroperabilityLevelBusinessObject&lt;/a&gt;

