  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ExternalTechnologyService">
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: External Service ABB is a Technology Service that enables the procedures to offer services that are delivered by a third-party organization or vendor.

Source: Inspired in Gartner

