  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/FederatedIdentityProviderTechnologyService">
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: Federated Identity Provider ABB is a Technology Service that enables users to access multiple applications and services across different organizations or domains using a single set of credentials

