  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/GraphDatabaseManagerTechnologyService">
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: Graph Database manager ABB is a Technology Service that implements the behaviour of a software system that manages and manipulates data stores in the form of nodes, edges, and properties, which are represented as a graph

