Interoperability saliency: The Machine Translation Component ABB &amp;nbsp;is salient for technical interoperability because it provides the implementation of functionalities for cross-lingual functionality by providing automated  translation of text, metadata and concept classes or nomenclatures as stated in the EIF recommendation n°16: &quot;Use information systems and technical architectures that cater for multilingualism when establishing a European public service. Decide on the level of multilingualism support based on the needs of the expected users.&quot;

Identifier: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/MachineTranslationApplicationComponent&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/MachineTranslationApplicationComponent&lt;/a&gt;

