EIRA concept: eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock

eira:ID	: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/PhysicalComputingInfrastructure&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/PhysicalComputingInfrastructure&lt;/a&gt;</skos:definition>
