    <skos:related rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ComputingHostingNetworkingandDataHostingInfrastructureTechnologyService"/>
  </skos:Concept>

  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/PhysicalNetworkInfrastructureEquipment">
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: The Physical Network Infrastructure ABB is an Equipment that enables connectivity and communication between users, devices, apps and the Internet.

Source: Inspired on relevant Physical Network Infrastructure providers

LOST view: Technical view - Infrastructure

Interoperability saliency: The Physical Network Infrastructure ABB is salient for technical interoperability because it provides the infrastructure to facilitate the hosting and execution of public administration services.

Identifier: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/PhysicalNetworkInfrastructureEquipment&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/PhysicalNetworkInfrastructureEquipment&lt;/a&gt;

