  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/PhysicalSecurityInfrastructureEquipment">
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: Physical Security Infrastructure ABB is Equipment that enables the protection of facilities and assets from actions and events that could cause damage or losses.

