  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/RemoteDesktopClientDevice">
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: Remote Desktop Client ABB is a Device that enables access, control and interaction with a remote computer located anywhere through the internet or internal network.

Source: Inspired in Gartner

Source reference: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gartner.com/en/information-technology/glossary/remote-access&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://www.gartner.com/en/information-technology/glossary/remote-access&lt;/a&gt;

LOST view: Technical view - Infrastructure

Interoperability saliency: The Remote Desktop Client ABB is salient for technical interoperability because it provides the physical element to remotely connect to shared workspaces to access public services.

Identifier: &lt;a href=&quot;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/RemoteDesktopClientDevice&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;http://data.europa.eu/dr8/RemoteDesktopClientDevice&lt;/a&gt;

