  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ServerNode">
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: Server ABB is a Node that enables access to resources or services to other computers or devices on a network

Source: Gartner

Source reference: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.gartner.com/en/information-technology/glossary/clientserver&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://www.gartner.com/en/information-technology/glossary/clientserver&lt;/a&gt;

