    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Definition: Technical Governance Content ABB is a Grouping that refers to formal decisions on technical frameworks, institutional arrangements, organisational structures, roles and responsibilities, policies, agreements and other aspects of ensuring and monitoring public services at national and EU levels

