  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/InteroperableEuropeanSolutionComponent">
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">DESCRIPTION:
Interoperable European Solution Component represents the encapsulation of a functionality provided by an Interoperable European Solution.

