Source: (&lt;a href=&quot;https://eur-lex.europa.eu/homepage.html?locale=en&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://eur-lex.europa.eu/homepage.html?locale=en&lt;/a&gt;)</skos:definition>
