    <eira:iopSaliency>The API Catalogue Catalogue Application Component ABB is salient for interoperability because the component is relevant for the software interfaces functionalities aligned with the implementation structures of solutions and digital public services. Those features and functionalities enable data consumption, processing and provision between digital public services.</eira:iopSaliency>
