  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/BusinessInteligenceTechnologyService_Properties">
    <dc:modified>2023-05-25</dc:modified>
    <skos:definition>Business Intelligence ABB is a Technology Service that enables the procedure of collecting, storing, and analysing the data produced by the public administration to improve and optimise decisions and performance.</skos:definition>
    <skos:notation>Properties of Business Intelligence</skos:notation>
    <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Properties of Business Intelligence</skos:prefLabel>
    <dc:type>eira:BusinessInteligenceTechnologyService</dc:type>
    <skos:example>The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): Central banks increasingly need to use business intelligence (BI) systems to collect, manage and analyse data in order to inform policy decisions. This report presents the results of a survey conducted by the BIS’s Irving Fisher Committee on Central Bank Statistics (IFC) in 2019. The following link gives access to a report on the use of BI in Central Banks. https://www.bis.org/ifc/publ/ifc_report_bi_1910.pdf</skos:example>
    <eira:PURI>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/BusinessInteligenceTechnologyService</eira:PURI>
    <eira:definitionSource>Inspired in Gartner</eira:definitionSource>
    <eira:concept>eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock</eira:concept>
    <eira:iopDimension>Structural IoP</eira:iopDimension>
    <eira:synonym></eira:synonym>
    <eira:iopSaliency>Business Intelligence ABB is salient for semantic interoperability because it provides visual and data understanding functionalities to be provided to the users in form of reports and other king of visual diagrams.</eira:iopSaliency>
    <skos:related rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/BusinessInteligenceTechnologyService"/>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/BusinessInteligenceTechnologyService</dc:identifier>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/BusinessInteligenceTechnologyService_Properties</dc:identifier>
    <eira:view>Technical view - infrastructure</eira:view>
    <eira:definitionSourceReference>https://www.gartner.com/en/information-technology/glossary/business-intelligence-bi</eira:definitionSourceReference>
    <skos:note></skos:note>
  </skos:Concept>

