    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/LegalInteroperabilitySpecification_Properties</dc:identifier>
  </skos:Concept>

  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/LegislationCatalogueBusinessObject_Properties">
    <dc:modified>2023-09-1</dc:modified>
    <skos:definition>Legislation Catalogue ABB is a Business Object creating an indexed inventory of legal documents with comprehensiveness and trustiness value.</skos:definition>
    <skos:notation>Properties of Legislation Catalogue</skos:notation>
    <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Properties of Legislation Catalogue</skos:prefLabel>
    <dc:type>eira:LegislationCatalogueBusinessObject</dc:type>
    <skos:example>The following implementation is an example of how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): EUR-Lex - It provides the official and most comprehensive access to EU legal documents. It is available in all of the EU’s 24 official languages and is updated daily. https://eur-lex.europa.eu/content/welcome/about.html</skos:example>
    <eira:concept>eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock</eira:concept>
    <eira:definitionSource>IATE</eira:definitionSource>
    <eira:PURI>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/LegislationCatalogueBusinessObject</eira:PURI>
    <eira:iopDimension>Structural IoP</eira:iopDimension>
    <eira:iopDimension>Governance IoP</eira:iopDimension>
    <eira:iopSaliency>The Legislation Catalogue ABB is a key interoperability enabler (*) for structural and governance interoperability enablers. It is salient for structural interoperability because it supports enabling sharing/provisioning and reusing/consumption of legislation on digital public services. The Legislation Catalogue ABB is also salient for the governance of interoperability because it compiles the legislation that needs to be discovered and applied for collaboration with other public administrations' digital public services, either because it is binding or because it is a source of strong recommendations.</eira:iopSaliency>
    <eira:synonym>Official Journal</eira:synonym>
    <eira:viewpoint>Key Interoperability Enablers viewpoint</eira:viewpoint>
    <skos:related rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/LegislationCatalogueBusinessObject"/>
    <eira:view>Legal view</eira:view>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/LegislationCatalogueBusinessObject_Properties</dc:identifier>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/LegislationCatalogueBusinessObject</dc:identifier>
    <eira:definitionSourceReference>http://iate.europa.eu/</eira:definitionSourceReference>
    <skos:note>DECISION (EU) 2015/2240 OF THE EUROPEAN PARLIAMENT AND OF THE COUNCIL of 25 November 2015 establishing a programme on interoperability solutions and common frameworks for European public administrations, businesses and citizens (ISA2 programme) as a means for modernising the public sector.</skos:note>
  </skos:Concept>

  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/LegislationOnDataInformationAndKnowledgeExchangeBusinessObject_Properties">
    <dc:modified>2023-05-25</dc:modified>
    <skos:definition>Legislation on Data information and Knowledge Exchange ABB is a Business Object that refers to the legal basis, rules and agreements that regulate how data is shared, accessed and used amng different actors and systems.</skos:definition>
    <skos:notation>Properties of Legislation on Data Information and Knowledge Exchange</skos:notation>
    <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Properties of Legislation on Data Information and Knowledge Exchange</skos:prefLabel>
    <dc:type>eira:LegislationOnDataInformationAndKnowledgeExchangeBusinessObject</dc:type>
    <skos:example>The following implementation is an example of how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): Commission Regulation (EU) 2015/703 of 30 April 2015 establishing a network code on interoperability and data exchange rules (Text with EEA relevance) http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2015/703/oj</skos:example>
    <eira:PURI>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/LegislationOnDataInformationAndKnowledgeExchangeBusinessObject</eira:PURI>
    <eira:definitionSource>Inspired in EIF</eira:definitionSource>
    <eira:concept>eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock</eira:concept>
    <eira:iopDimension>Governance IoP</eira:iopDimension>
    <eira:iopSaliency>The Legislation on Data Information and knowledge exchange ABB is a key interoperability enabler (*) for the governance, behavioural, structural and semantic interoperability because it sets rules that relate specifically to i) the reuse of solutions in the context of digital public services, ii) the exchange of digital data, information and knowledge, iii) the collaboration amongst the public administrations' digital services, and iv) the determination of standard data exchange models to facilitate data harmonization.</eira:iopSaliency>
    <eira:synonym></eira:synonym>
    <eira:viewpoint>Key Interoperability Enablers viewpoint</eira:viewpoint>
    <eira:view>Legal view</eira:view>
    <skos:related rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/LegislationOnDataInformationAndKnowledgeExchangeBusinessObject"/>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/LegislationOnDataInformationAndKnowledgeExchangeBusinessObject_Properties</dc:identifier>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/LegislationOnDataInformationAndKnowledgeExchangeBusinessObject</dc:identifier>
    <eira:definitionSourceReference>https://eur-lex.europa.eu/resource.html?uri=cellar:2c2f2554-0faf-11e7-8a35-01aa75ed71a1.0017.02/DOC_1&amp;format=PDF</eira:definitionSourceReference>
    <skos:note></skos:note>
  </skos:Concept>

  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/LegislationOnDigitalPublicServicesBusinessObject_Properties">
    <dc:modified>2023-10-1</dc:modified>
    <skos:definition>Legislation on Digital Public Services ABB is a Business formalising a set of rules and requirements concerning digital public services.</skos:definition>
    <skos:notation>Properties of Legislation on Digital Public Services</skos:notation>
    <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Properties of Legislation on Digital Public Services</skos:prefLabel>
    <dc:type>eira:LegislationOnDigitalPublicServicesBusinessObject</dc:type>
    <skos:example>The following implementation is an example of how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): The binding and non-binding legislation produced towards the Digital Single Market. https://www.consilium.europa.eu/en/policies/digital-single-market/), and any of the national efforts towards the alignment to the European Digital Strategy (e.g., DigitalES in Europe (https://www.digitales.es/en/digitales-in-europe/</skos:example>
    <eira:concept>eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock</eira:concept>
    <eira:definitionSource>Inspired on the content of the Digital Services Act package</eira:definitionSource>
    <eira:PURI>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/LegislationOnDigitalPublicServicesBusinessObject</eira:PURI>
    <eira:iopDimension>Behavioral IoP</eira:iopDimension>
    <eira:iopDimension>Structural IoP</eira:iopDimension>
    <eira:iopDimension>Governance IoP</eira:iopDimension>
    <eira:iopSaliency>The Legislation on Digital Public Services ABB is salient for the governance, behavioural and structural interoperability because it sets rules that relate specifically to i) the reuse of solutions in the context of digital public services, ii) the exchange of digital data, information and knowledge, and iii) the collaboration amongst the public administrations' digital services.</eira:iopSaliency>
    <eira:view>Legal view</eira:view>
    <skos:related rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/LegislationOnDigitalPublicServicesBusinessObject"/>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/LegislationOnDigitalPublicServicesBusinessObject</dc:identifier>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/LegislationOnDigitalPublicServicesBusinessObject_Properties</dc:identifier>
    <eira:definitionSourceReference>https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/policies/digital-services-act-package</eira:definitionSourceReference>
  </skos:Concept>

  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/LifecycleManagementService_Properties">
    <dc:modified>2023-05-25</dc:modified>
    <skos:notation>Properties of Lifecycle Management Service</skos:notation>
    <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Properties of Lifecycle Management Service</skos:prefLabel>
    <dc:type>eira:LifecycleManagementService</dc:type>
    <eira:ABB_Status>Obsolete</eira:ABB_Status>
    <eira:ID>ABB138</eira:ID>
