  </skos:Concept>

  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/MetadataCatalogueDataObject_Properties">
    <dc:modified>2022-01-26</dc:modified>
    <skos:definition>Metadata Catalogue ABB is a Data Object that represents the collection of of descriptive information about data, resources or information objects related to public services.</skos:definition>
    <skos:notation>Properties of Metadata Catalogue</skos:notation>
    <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Properties of Metadata Catalogue</skos:prefLabel>
    <dc:type>eira:MetadataCatalogueDataObject</dc:type>
    <skos:example>The following implementation is an example of how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): CESSDA Data Catalogue https://www.cessda.eu/Tools/Data-Catalogue</skos:example>
    <eira:concept>eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock</eira:concept>
    <eira:definitionSource>INSPIRE</eira:definitionSource>
    <eira:PURI>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/MetadataCatalogueDataObject</eira:PURI>
    <eira:iopDimension>Structural IoP</eira:iopDimension>
    <eira:iopSaliency>The Metadata Catalogue ABB is a key interoperability enabler supporting semantic interoperability because metadata catalogue is a collection of descriptive information about data and information related to digital public services. The usage of standardised methods can enable successful data discoverability and reuse supporting the implementation of digital public services across borders.</eira:iopSaliency>
    <eira:synonym></eira:synonym>
    <eira:view>Semantic view</eira:view>
    <skos:related rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/MetadataCatalogueDataObject"/>
    <eira:definitionSourceReference>https://inspire.ec.europa.eu/training/metadata-and-catalogue-services</eira:definitionSourceReference>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/MetadataCatalogueDataObject_Properties</dc:identifier>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/MetadataCatalogueDataObject</dc:identifier>
    <skos:note></skos:note>
  </skos:Concept>

  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/MetadataDataObject_Properties">
    <dc:modified>2022-01-17</dc:modified>
    <skos:definition>Metadata ABB is a Data Object providing information about one or more aspects of the data</skos:definition>
    <skos:notation>Properties of Metadata</skos:notation>
    <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Properties of Metadata</skos:prefLabel>
    <dc:type>eira:MetadataDataObject</dc:type>
    <skos:example>The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): https://data.europa.eu/en</skos:example>
    <eira:definitionSource>W3C</eira:definitionSource>
    <eira:PURI>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/MetadataDataObject</eira:PURI>
    <eira:concept>eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock</eira:concept>
    <eira:iopDimension>Behavioral IoP</eira:iopDimension>
    <eira:iopSaliency>The Metadata ABB is a key interoperability enabler (*) for behavioural interoperability by enabling data discoverability and reuse enhancing the delivery and collaboration between digital public services.</eira:iopSaliency>
    <eira:synonym></eira:synonym>
    <eira:viewpoint>Key Interoperability Enablers viewpoint</eira:viewpoint>
    <eira:view>Semantic view</eira:view>
    <skos:related rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/MetadataDataObject"/>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/MetadataDataObject_Properties</dc:identifier>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/MetadataDataObject</dc:identifier>
    <eira:definitionSourceReference>www.w3.org/Metadata/</eira:definitionSourceReference>
    <skos:note></skos:note>
  </skos:Concept>

  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/MetadataManagementApplicationComponent_Properties">
    <dc:modified>2022-01-20</dc:modified>
    <skos:definition>Metadata Management ABB is an Application Component that enables the implementation of components for the i) creation, ii) storage, iii) categorisation and iv) retrieval of metadata.</skos:definition>
    <skos:notation>Properties of Metadata Management</skos:notation>
    <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Properties of Metadata Management</skos:prefLabel>
    <dc:type>eira:MetadataManagementApplicationComponent</dc:type>
    <skos:example>The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): Eurostat SDMX repository: The Euro SDMX Registry is Eurostat’s implementation of an SDMX registry to facilitate the exchange of statistical data and metadata by serving as a metadata repository. It stores the SDMX artefacts needed for the parties to access and interpret the content of the exchanged statistical data and metadata sets. http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/sdmx-infospace/sdmx-it-tools/sdmx-registry</skos:example>
    <eira:PURI>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/MetadataManagementApplicationComponent</eira:PURI>
    <eira:definitionSource>DAMA</eira:definitionSource>
    <eira:concept>eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock</eira:concept>
    <eira:iopSaliency>The Metadata management Component ABB is an application component providing the implementation of the functionalities to manage metadata. EIF recommends to prioritise it: &quot;Put in place an information management strategy at the highest possible level to avoid fragmentation and duplication. Management of metadata, master data and reference data should be prioritised.&quot;</eira:iopSaliency>
    <eira:iopDimension>Structural IoP</eira:iopDimension>
    <eira:synonym></eira:synonym>
    <eira:viewpoint>Interoperability Privacy viewpoint</eira:viewpoint>
    <eira:view>Technical view - application</eira:view>
    <skos:related rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/MetadataManagementApplicationComponent"/>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/MetadataManagementApplicationComponent_Properties</dc:identifier>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/MetadataManagementApplicationComponent</dc:identifier>
    <eira:definitionSourceReference>http://www.dama.org/</eira:definitionSourceReference>
    <skos:note></skos:note>
  </skos:Concept>

  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/MetadataManagementApplicationService_Properties">
    <dc:modified>2022-01-20</dc:modified>
    <skos:definition>Metadata Management ABB is an Application Service that enables functionalities for the i) creation, ii) storage, iii) categorisation and iv) retrieval of metadata.</skos:definition>
    <skos:notation>Properties of Metadata Management</skos:notation>
    <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Properties of Metadata Management</skos:prefLabel>
    <dc:type>eira:MetadataManagementApplicationService</dc:type>
    <skos:example>The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): Eurostat SDMX repository: The Euro SDMX Registry is Eurostat’s implementation of an SDMX registry to facilitate the exchange of statistical data and metadata by serving as a metadata repository. It stores the SDMX artefacts needed for the parties to access and interpret the content of the exchanged statistical data and metadata sets. http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/sdmx-infospace/sdmx-it-tools/sdmx-registry</skos:example>
    <eira:definitionSource>DAMA</eira:definitionSource>
    <eira:PURI>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/MetadataManagementApplicationService</eira:PURI>
    <eira:concept>eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock</eira:concept>
    <eira:iopSaliency>The Metadata management Service ABB  is salient for interoperability  because it provides and shares the functionalities to manage metadata. EIF recommends to prioritise it: &quot;Put in place an information management strategy at the highest possible level to avoid fragmentation and duplication. Management of metadata, master data and reference data should be prioritised&quot;.</eira:iopSaliency>
    <eira:iopDimension>Behavioral IoP</eira:iopDimension>
    <eira:synonym></eira:synonym>
    <eira:viewpoint>Interoperability Privacy viewpoint</eira:viewpoint>
    <eira:view>Technical view - application</eira:view>
    <skos:related rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/MetadataManagementApplicationService"/>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/MetadataManagementApplicationService</dc:identifier>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/MetadataManagementApplicationService_Properties</dc:identifier>
    <eira:definitionSourceReference>http://www.dama.org/</eira:definitionSourceReference>
    <skos:note></skos:note>
  </skos:Concept>

  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/MobileAppBusinessInterface_Properties">
    <dc:modified>2022-01-20</dc:modified>
    <skos:definition>Mobile APP ABB is a Business Interface that corresponds to a computer program designed to run on a mobile device, such as a smartphone or tablet</skos:definition>
    <skos:notation>Properties of Mobile App</skos:notation>
    <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Properties of Mobile App</skos:prefLabel>
    <dc:type>eira:MobileAppBusinessInterface</dc:type>
    <skos:example>The following implementation is an example of how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): EU Council mobile app. https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=eu.europa.publications.eucouncil&amp;hl=en_US&amp;gl=US&amp;pli=1</skos:example>
    <eira:PURI>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/MobileAppBusinessInterface</eira:PURI>
    <eira:definitionSource>ISO/IEC 29179:2012</eira:definitionSource>
    <eira:concept>eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock</eira:concept>
    <eira:iopDimension>Structural IoP</eira:iopDimension>
    <eira:iopDimension>Behavioral IoP</eira:iopDimension>
    <eira:iopSaliency>Mobile App ABB is salient for organizational, semantic and technical interoperability because it offers (i) a visual environment to interact with the public service procedures and data; (ii) an understanding of the information to be represented; and (iii) an elaborate mechanism to exchange data with public services.</eira:iopSaliency>
    <eira:synonym></eira:synonym>
    <eira:view>Organisational view</eira:view>
    <skos:related rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/MobileAppBusinessInterface"/>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/MobileAppBusinessInterface_Properties</dc:identifier>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/MobileAppBusinessInterface</dc:identifier>
    <eira:definitionSourceReference>https://www.iso.org/standard/45258.html</eira:definitionSourceReference>
    <skos:note></skos:note>
  </skos:Concept>

  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/Multilingualism_Properties">
    <dc:modified>2023-05-25</dc:modified>
    <skos:notation>Properties of Multilingualism</skos:notation>
