  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/SensorDevice_Properties">
    <dc:modified>2023-05-25</dc:modified>
    <skos:definition>Sensor ABB is a Device that that detects and responds to events or changes in the physical environment.</skos:definition>
    <skos:notation>Properties of Sensor</skos:notation>
    <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Properties of Sensor</skos:prefLabel>
    <dc:type>eira:SensorDevice</dc:type>
    <eira:PURI>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/SensorDevice</eira:PURI>
    <eira:concept>eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock</eira:concept>
    <eira:iopSaliency>The Sensor ABB is salient for technical interoperability because it provides needed observational elements to measure specific elements that serve to improve eGovernance services.</eira:iopSaliency>
    <eira:iopDimension>Structural IoP</eira:iopDimension>
    <eira:definitionSource>Inspired in SAREF</eira:definitionSource>
    <eira:synonym></eira:synonym>
    <eira:view>Technical view - infrastructure</eira:view>
    <skos:related rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/SensorDevice"/>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/SensorDevice_Properties</dc:identifier>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/SensorDevice</dc:identifier>
    <skos:note>Sensors convert physical inputs into electrical signals that can be processed and analyzed by electronic systems or software</skos:note>
    <eira:definitionSourceReference>https://saref.etsi.org/core/Sensor</eira:definitionSourceReference>
  </skos:Concept>

  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ServerNode_Properties">
    <dc:modified>2022-01-31</dc:modified>
    <skos:definition>Server ABB is a Node that enables access to resources or services to other computers or devices on a network</skos:definition>
    <skos:notation>Properties of Server</skos:notation>
    <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Properties of Server</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:example>The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): DIGIT/C Hosting Service - DIGIT/C offers a high availability and high performance hosting infrastructure that is being comprised, among other elements, of back-end web server instances and application servers for hosting and serving both static and dynamic sites. http://ec.europa.eu/ipg/build/infrastructure/index_en.htm</skos:example>
    <dc:type>eira:ServerNode</dc:type>
    <eira:PURI>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ServerNode</eira:PURI>
    <eira:concept>eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock</eira:concept>
    <eira:iopDimension>Behavioral IoP</eira:iopDimension>
    <eira:iopDimension>Structural IoP</eira:iopDimension>
    <eira:iopSaliency>The Server ABB is salient for technical interoperability because it provides the capabilities to host public administration services at both levels, internally and externally.</eira:iopSaliency>
    <eira:definitionSource>Gartner</eira:definitionSource>
    <eira:synonym></eira:synonym>
    <eira:view>Technical view - infrastructure</eira:view>
    <skos:related rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ServerNode"/>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ServerNode</dc:identifier>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ServerNode_Properties</dc:identifier>
    <eira:definitionSourceReference>https://www.gartner.com/en/information-technology/glossary/clientserver</eira:definitionSourceReference>
    <skos:note></skos:note>
  </skos:Concept>

  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ServerlessOrchestratorTechnologyService_Properties">
    <dc:modified>2022-01-31</dc:modified>
    <skos:definition>Serveless Orchestration ABB is a Technology Service that implements the behaviour of coordinating and managing individual functions are deployed as separate, independent units of code that can be executed in response to specific events or triggers.</skos:definition>
    <skos:notation>Properties of Serverless Orchestrator</skos:notation>
    <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Properties of Serverless Orchestrator</skos:prefLabel>
    <dc:type>eira:ServerlessOrchestratorTechnologyService</dc:type>
    <skos:example>The following implementation is an example of how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): Architecture of Orchestration for serverless computing. https://ec.europa.eu/research/participants/documents/downloadPublic?documentIds=080166e5d0f56561&amp;appId=PPGMS</skos:example>
    <eira:concept>eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock</eira:concept>
    <eira:PURI>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ServerlessOrchestratorTechnologyService</eira:PURI>
    <eira:iopSaliency>Serverless Orchestrator ABB is salient for technical interoperability because it establishes the events and individual functions to combine information from legacy and public administrations service to respond to the applications and stakeholders that consume its information.</eira:iopSaliency>
    <eira:definitionSource>inspired in RedHat</eira:definitionSource>
    <eira:iopDimension>Structural IoP</eira:iopDimension>
    <eira:synonym></eira:synonym>
    <eira:view>Technical view - infrastructure</eira:view>
    <skos:related rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ServerlessOrchestratorTechnologyService"/>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ServerlessOrchestratorTechnologyService_Properties</dc:identifier>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ServerlessOrchestratorTechnologyService</dc:identifier>
    <skos:note></skos:note>
    <eira:definitionSourceReference>https://www.redhat.com/en/topics/cloud-native-apps/what-is-serverless</eira:definitionSourceReference>
  </skos:Concept>

  <skos:Concept rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ServiceAppBusinessInterface_Properties">
    <dc:modified>2023-05-25</dc:modified>
    <skos:definition>Service APP ABB is a Business Interface is a a type of software application that provides specific functionality to other applications or users within a larger system. Service applications are designed to operate in the background and provide specific services, such as database access, messaging, authentication, or other functionality, to other applications that require those services</skos:definition>
    <skos:notation>Properties of Service App</skos:notation>
    <skos:topConceptOf rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">Properties of Service App</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:example>The following implementation is an example on how this specific Architecture Building Block (ABB) can be instantiated as a Solution Building Block (SBB): EUROTRACE is a powerful and flexible software application that provides the structures and tools for the management of statistical data. EUROTRACE can be used as a production system for the integration, validation and management of statistical datasets and can be used with the following DBMS: MS ACCESS, ORACLE, SQL Server. https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/sites/default/files/document/2014-04/Eurotrace%20DBMS%202.6%20UG_EN.pdf</skos:example>
    <dc:type>eira:ServiceAppBusinessInterface</dc:type>
    <eira:concept>eira:ArchitectureBuildingBlock</eira:concept>
    <eira:PURI>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ServiceAppBusinessInterface</eira:PURI>
    <eira:iopDimension>Structural IoP</eira:iopDimension>
    <eira:iopDimension>Behavioral IoP</eira:iopDimension>
    <eira:iopSaliency>Service App ABB is salient for organizational, semantic and technical interoperability because it establishes the mechanisms to provide data and services to public service consumers. The Service App ABB will identify and implement needed mechanisms to (i) deliver data according to the digital service procedures, and (ii) enable service and data discovery.</eira:iopSaliency>
    <eira:definitionSource>Inspired in ETSI TR 103 290</eira:definitionSource>
    <eira:synonym></eira:synonym>
    <skos:related rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ServiceAppBusinessInterface"/>
    <eira:view>Organisational view</eira:view>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ServiceAppBusinessInterface_Properties</dc:identifier>
    <dc:identifier>http://data.europa.eu/dr8/ServiceAppBusinessInterface</dc:identifier>
    <eira:definitionSourceReference>https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_tr/103200_103299/103290/01.01.01_60/tr_103290v010101p.pdf</eira:definitionSourceReference>
    <skos:note></skos:note>
  </skos:Concept>

